          "partialFingerprints": {
            "vibeguard": "b70e39a3c75ecd93"
          },
          "message": {
            "text": "A session-shaped cookie is set without the full httpOnly + secure + sameSite flags. Script-readable session cookies turn any XSS into account takeover; missing Secure leaks them over HTTP. Fix: cookies().set(\"session\", v, { httpOnly: true, secure: true, sameSite: \"lax\", path: \"/\" }) — or the equivalent in your framework."
